# Work item docs

- Copy from `docs/templates/`. Do not invent new section names unless an ADR says so.
- Acceptance criteria must be testable (input → observable result), not slogans.
- Keep `docs/decisions/` for lasting WHY. Do not dump one-off task notes there.
- Status on a work folder: `draft` → `approved` → `in-progress` → `done` (or `abandoned`).
